Well, if you insist, I'll let you have
another very exciting battle{VAR BE00}
with me tomorrow!

I like you!{VAR BE01}
I will let you see a very special thing,
so follow me!{VAR BE01}

The sea... ♪ It's a source of life... ♪
The sea... ♪ It's a lot of water... ♪{VAR BE01}
So, teach this move to your Pokémon, and
you can dive into the sea!{VAR BE01}

Inside this Hidden Machine is Dive!{VAR BE01}
The darkest parts of the sea are called
diving points, and if you use Dive there,{VAR BE00}
you can dive all the way to the bottom of{VAR BE00}
the sea!

Even Maids sometimes have to roost.{VAR BE01}
Oh, I was confused! A Pokémon restores
its HP when it uses the move Roost!{VAR BE01}
But for people, it's called resting.

The sunlight is strong...{VAR BE01}
Depending on the Pokémon, that can be
either an advantage or a disadvantage.{VAR BE01}
Strong sunlight makes Fire-type moves
stronger and Water-type moves weaker.
